Package: camera-coordinator
Version: 1.0.0
Section: video
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Shuhao Wu <shuhao@shuhaowu.com>
Depends: libc6, init-system-helpers
Homepage: https://github.com/shuhaowu/cameracoordinator
Description: A service that emits D-Bus events and calls scripts when webcams turn on and off.
